sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client
  participant Gateway as claudication
  participant Pool as Account pool
  participant Up as Upstream

  Client->>Gateway: request, naming one of its model names
  Gateway->>Gateway: key check, limits, budget
  Gateway->>Gateway: name → real model → provider
  Gateway->>Gateway: translate, if the client's API is not the upstream's
  loop until answered, or no account is left
    Gateway->>Pool: lease an account that serves the model
    Pool-->>Gateway: the highest-priority account with room
    Gateway->>Up: the request, with the account's credential
    alt refused for a reason another account may not have
      Up-->>Gateway: 429 / 5xx
      Gateway->>Pool: cool the account (or just that model) down
    else answered
      Up-->>Gateway: the answer, streamed
    end
  end
  Gateway-->>Client: the answer in the client's own API, usage recorded
